            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Condividi con Recipe Pals un link HTTPS pubblico, testo leggibile, un’immagine o un PDF."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original shared source is missing. Share it again.": {
      "comment": "Localized shared/core/service message.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原始分享内容已丢失，请重新分享。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原始分享內容已遺失，請重新分享。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "共有元のコンテンツが見つかりません。もう一度共有してください。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die ursprüngliche geteilte Quelle fehlt. Teile sie erneut."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La source partagée d’origine est manquante. Partagez-la à nouveau."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Falta la fuente compartida original. Vuelve a compartirla."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La fonte originale condivisa è mancante. Condividila di nuovo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server has not confirmed durable queue admission. The saved source remains available.": {
      "comment": "Localized shared/core/service message.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器尚未确认接收导入任务，已保存的来源仍可使用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "伺服器尚未確認接收匯入工作，已儲存的來源仍可使用。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "サーバーがインポートの受付を確認していません。保存済みのソースは引き続き利用できます。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Server hat die dauerhafte Aufnahme in die Warteschlange nicht bestätigt. Die gespeicherte Quelle bleibt verfügbar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le serveur n’a pas confirmé l’enregistrement durable dans la file d’attente. La source enregistrée reste disponible."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El servidor no ha confirmado que la fuente se haya añadido de forma duradera a la cola. La fuente guardada sigue disponible."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il server non ha confermato l’inserimento persistente nella coda. La fonte salvata resta disponibile."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server response did not match this saved source. The local receipt was kept.": {
      "comment": "Localized shared/core/service message.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器响应与已保存的来源不匹配，本地记录已保留。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "伺服器回應與已儲存的來源不符，本機紀錄已保留。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "サーバーの応答が保存済みソースと一致しません。ローカルの記録は保持しました。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Serverantwort passte nicht zu dieser gespeicherten Quelle. Die lokale Empfangsbestätigung wurde beibehalten."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La réponse du serveur ne correspond pas à cette source enregistrée. Le reçu local a été conservé."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La respuesta del servidor no corresponde a esta fuente guardada. El recibo local se ha conservado."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La risposta del server non corrisponde a questa fonte salvata. La ricevuta locale è stata conservata."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved source was removed while it was processing. No recipe was added.": {
      "comment": "Localized shared/core/service message.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "处理期间已保存的来源被移除，未添加食谱。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "處理期間已儲存的來源遭移除，未新增食譜。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "処理中に保存済みソースが削除されたため、レシピは追加されませんでした。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die gespeicherte Quelle wurde während der Verarbeitung entfernt. Es wurde kein Rezept hinzugefügt."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La source enregistrée a été retirée pendant son traitement. Aucune recette n’a été ajoutée."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La fuente guardada se eliminó mientras se procesaba. No se ha añadido ninguna receta."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La fonte salvata è stata rimossa durante l’elaborazione. Non è stata aggiunta alcuna ricetta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server finished processing without a recipe result. The original source remains saved.": {
      "comment": "Localized shared/core/service message.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器已处理完成，但未返回食谱。原始来源仍已保存。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "伺服器已處理完成，但未傳回食譜。原始來源仍已儲存。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "サーバーの処理は完了しましたが、レシピが返されませんでした。元のソースは保存されています。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
